    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A wonderful opportunity to acquire this extended four bedroom detached bungalow situated in this mature and much sought after residential location. The property has been very well maintained throughout is both bright and spacious and whilst some upgrading may be required this will make for an ideal and comfortable family home. The property is within a short drive to the city centre and within walking distance of both the CUH and Bons Secours Hospital, UCC, MTU and all local amenities to include various shopping centres, bars and restaurants, schools and sports facilities."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "HALLWAY \r\nCarpet, Wood Floor, Telephone Point, Radiator.                                                                      \r\nLIVING ROOM                                                                                                                                      12.6 x 10.7\r\nCarpet, Fireplace with Marble Surround, Built in Display Unit, Bay Window, Curtains, Blinds, \r\nRadiator, Power Points, TV Point.\r\nKITCHEN/DINING ROOM                                                                                                                    21.7 x 10.0\r\nCarpet & Vinyl Floor, Oak Wall & Floor Units, Cooker Point, Extractor Fan, Plumbed for Washing \r\nMachine/Dryer, Curtains, Radiator, Power Points.\r\nSTORAGE ROOM                                                                                                                                   8.0 x 5.5     \r\nWood Floor, Radiator, Power Points.\r\nBEDROOM 1                                                                                                                                        12.7 x 11.9     \r\nCarpet, Curtains, Bay Window, Radiator, Power Points.\r\nBEDROOM 2                                                                                                                                          11.9 x 9.9\r\nCarpet, Curtains, Radiator, Power Points.\r\nBEDROOM 3                                                                                                                                            9.0 x 9.0\r\nCarpet, Curtains, Radiator, Power Points.\r\nBEDROOM 4                                                                                                                                        11.9 x 11.4 \r\nCarpet, Curtains, Radiator, Power Points.\r\nBATHROOM                                                                                                                                            7.9 x 6.5\r\nVinyl Floor, W.C., W.H.B., Electric Shower Unit, Hot Press, Fully Tiled."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "SERVICES\r\nMains Water/Drainage, E.S.B, Telephone, Broadband.\r\nHEATING                                                                                      \r\nOil Fired Central Heating System.\r\nWINDOWS\r\nDouble Glazed PVC Windows\r\nOUTSIDE/OTHER                                                                          \r\nTotal Floor Area  105 Sq Mtrs / 1130 Sq Ft                                                           \r\nMature Gardens South Facing to the Rear.\r\nDriveway with Attached Garage (16.9 x 9.10).\r\nThe Property was Underpinned in 2009."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: F\r\nBER NO: 119443901"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
